SUMMARY:Turning Fragments into Art: Collage Workshop
LOCATION:Marina District\, null null San Francisco\, San Francisco
DESCRIPTION:Our lives are full of fragments: half-finished thoughts\, ling
 ering memories\, loose ends. We carry them around with us\, trying to fig
 ure out how to make them fit into the larger story of our lives. But what
  if the pieces don’t have to fit in the way we imagined? What if\, inst
 ead of trying to figure it all out\, we gave ourselves permission to play
